&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;50c96-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Principal in Sales Enablement, you will leverage your background as a top-performing Account Executive enable Elastic AEs. This role will working closely with AMER Sales Leadership to pinpoint performance gaps using data, designing tailored enablement and deliver the training that will genuinely help our sales team succeed. If you&#39;re motivated by the opportunity to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1m:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;50c96-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;empower&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;50c96-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; others and create impactful learning experiences, this position allows you to do just that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diagnose Performance Gaps:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Partner directly with AMER Area and Regional VPs and RevOps to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1o:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;analyze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bgnj6-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; sales data (Gong, Salesforce, Clari) and identify performance gaps and root causes in order to prescribe relevant targeted remediation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bfmh2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bfmh2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bfmh2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Targeted Enablement:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bfmh2-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Shift away from &quot;one-size-fits-all&quot; training. Design and deliver blended remediation programs tailored to specific seller cohorts showing performance gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;digq-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;digq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;digq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;End-to-End Program Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;digq-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Orchestrate the entire lifecycle of AMER training experiences—from initial scoping to live delivery and post-training reinforcement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e6un6-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e6un6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e6un6-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Methodology Embedding:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e6un6-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the Geo champion for MEDDPICC and Value Selling. Host live deal clinics, pipeline review sessions, and opportunity coaching workshops to embed qualification rigor into daily pipeline management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ed8f0-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ed8f0-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ed8f0-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ed8f0-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design and deliver interactive training on core GTM topics, including Sales Process Execution, Value Frameworks, MEDDPICC Qualification, Pipeline Forecasting, and AI for Sellers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;b005b-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;b005b-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b005b-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Generative AI:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b005b-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Teach sellers how to embed GenAI tools (Claude, Gemini, NotebookLM, Gong, Avarra) directly into their daily sales motions for account research, discovery prep, deal analysis, and pipeline generation activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cep5c-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cep5c-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cep5c-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Sales Tool Mastery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cep5c-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Teach AEs how to leverage the sales tech stack and drive deep adoption and mastery of the AMER sales technology ecosystem, including Salesforce, Seismic, Clari, Outreach, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Demandbase, and Gong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cht33-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cht33-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cht33-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop and Maintain a Seller’s Toolkit: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cht33-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Regularly audit self-serve enablement assets to ensure alignment with evolving processes. Identify overlapping sales tools to eliminate redundant friction and ensure our stack evolves alongside business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;51os9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;51os9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;51os9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Connect Training to Sales Outcomes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;51os9-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Partner with RevOps to establish measurement frameworks connecting content usage and training participation directly to core GTM metrics (e.g., win rates, average contract value (ACV), sales cycle length, and quarterly quota attainment).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6b19b-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6b19b-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6b19b-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Feedback Loops:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6b19b-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Lead the AMER Enablement Advisory Board. Standardize feedback mechanisms and data dashboards to prove enablement ROI and continuously refine program design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;gl23-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;gl23-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;gl23-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with various teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;gl23-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product Marketing (PMM), RevOps, Learning Design, Outreach/Seismic/Gong Admins, Sales Programs, Product Enablement Leads, and the Sales Excellence Lead. Your goal is to equip Regional VPs with the tools they need to support adoption at the frontline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-ul&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7dmon-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7dmon-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7dmon-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7dmon-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;3+ years of B2B tech/SaaS sales experience as a top-performing Account Executive (preferably within AI, database, observability, or cybersecurity). You know how to manage a complex deal cycle, build champions, and close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d9qvl-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d9qvl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d9qvl-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in sales enablement, field coaching, or sales training. You have a knack for breaking down complex technical concepts and sales frameworks into &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1q:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d9qvl-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;practical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d9qvl-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, step-by-step actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmnhb-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmnhb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cmnhb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep hands-on experience applying enterprise frameworks like MEDDPICC / MEDDICC, Value-Based Selling, and Force Management’s Command of the Message in live sales environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8k02l-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8k02l-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8k02l-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficiency with sales tools (Salesforce, Seismic, Clari, Outreach, Gong) and early adopter mindset with Generative AI platforms (Claude, Gemini, NotebookLM).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1s:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;analyze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; pipeline diagnostics and deal velocity to pinpoint execution gaps and measure program &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1u:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;effectiveness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3ndf-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1cslp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9pki-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9pki-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9pki-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;High &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r20:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9pki-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;energy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9pki-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, executive presence, and the ability to command a room—whether facilitating an executive strategy session or running an interactive pitch clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary.&amp;nbsp; This role does not have a variable compensation component.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The typical starting salary range for new hires in this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp; In select locations (including Seattle WA, Los Angeles CA, the San Francisco Bay Area CA, and the New York City Metro Area), an alternate range may apply as specified below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;These ranges represent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;the lowest to highest salary we reasonably and in good faith believe we would pay for this role at the time of this posting.&amp;nbsp; We may ultimately pay more or less than the posted range, and the ranges may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An employee&#39;s position within the salary range will be based on several factors including, but not limited to, relevant education, qualifications, certifications, experience, skills, geographic location, performance, and business or organizational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Elastic believes that employees should have the opportunity to share in the value that we create together for our shareholders. Therefore, in addition to cash compensation, this role is currently eligible to participate in Elastic&#39;s stock program.&amp;nbsp; Our total rewards package also includes a company-matched 401k with dollar-for-dollar matching up to 6% of eligible earnings, along with a range of other benefits offered with a holistic emphasis on employee well-being.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The typical starting salary range for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$128,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$202,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The typical starting salary range for this role in the select locations listed above is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$153,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$243,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
